name wiktextract-kaikki
# The entries of one language, as kaikki.org gives them: the same JSON object on every line as in the raw file
# (see wiktextract.recipe for what Wiktextract's README says of it), and read the same way, so that what two
# editions say of the same entry, they say of the same thing. Here a sense also holds an "id" of its own
# (en-dictionary-en-noun-hIt8uVcE), which is said of the sense like everything else it holds.
match kaikki.org-dictionary-*.jsonl
grammar json
records
named word by lang_code word pos etymology_number
identity * title
identity senses glosses
identity forms form
identity examples text
specifics claims under senses
tuples
